==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|fjórtán]]'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*fedurtehun}}.
===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[fourteen]]; the cardinal number after [[þrettán#Icelandic|þrettán]] and before [[fimmtán#Icelandic|fimmtán]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[fjórtándi]] {{g|m}}, [[fjórtánda]] {{g|f|n}}.

